{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04879","headline":"玄元观寻李先生不遇 · 魏知古","name":"玄元观寻李先生不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽客今何在，空寻伊洛间。\n忽闻归苦县，复想入函关。\n未作千年别，犹应七日还。\n神仙不可见，寂寞返蓬山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏知古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}